# Safety net: this folder lives in a git repo that gets pushed to GitHub.
# The public key (.pub) is safe to commit. The PRIVATE key must never be
# committed here or anywhere else in this repo -- these patterns block it
# even if it's accidentally copied into this folder later.
gh-actions-deploy-key
*deploy-key
!*.pub
id_rsa
id_ed25519
*.pem
*.key
